        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I am *extremely* grateful for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nAnd yes, this particular module is somewhat important to me to the point that I'd like to implement it myself. Also, the part of the plan is for it to have some \"standardized\" interface of creating a window (either float or split) which can be reused for similar task in other modules. This requires review of where it is already done (to maybe adjust if the design is not good enough) or can be done in the future.\r\n\r\nUsing your linked implementation as a reference will save me considerable amount of time in the future. It contains the \"send to REPL\" implementation part which I didn't have time to fully wrap my head around. So this is already in itself a great contribution on your part :) Thank you very much!\r\n\r\nI'll close this now but will definitely get back to it later.",
